### 2.13 Porter–Kirisame–Wei–Panchekha–Omar, "Incremental Bidirectional Typing via Order Maintenance", OOPSLA 2025
arXiv 2504.08946 · file `porter2025-incremental-bidirectional-typing.pdf`
