is a repair of 𝔄 for 𝜓. Conversely, for every repair 𝑅 ⊆ 𝑅 + ∪ 𝑅 − of 𝔄 for 𝜓, there is a monomial 𝑚 of 𝜋 [[𝜓]] such that
